d news.</p>\n\n\n\n**This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.**\n\nCopyright © 2025 Pureinfotech • Windows 10 &amp; Windows 11 help for humans  All Rights Reserved. \n\t\t\t\tDesign new host by <a href=\"/\" rel=\"designer\">mh</a> version 5.2025.2431\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n<link href=\"https://pureinfotech.com/wp-includes/js/dist/script-modules/interactivity/index.min.js\" id=\"@wordpress/interactivity-js-modulepreload\" rel=\"modulepreload\"/>\n<link href=\"//cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/cookieconsent2/3.0.3/cookieconsent.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"5\" id=\"wpstats\" src=\"https://pixel.wp.com/g.gif?v=ext&amp;blog=15090528&amp;post=138426&amp;tz=-4&amp;srv=pureinfotech.com&amp;j=1%3A14.8&amp;...\" width=\"6\"/><img src=\"https://ad-delivery.net/px.gif?ch=2\" style=\"display: none !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important;\"/><img src=\"https://ad.doubleclick.net/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&amp;ad_box_=1&amp;adnet=1&amp;showad=1&amp;size=250x250\" style=\"display: none !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important;\"/><img src=\"https://ad-delivery.net/px.gif?ch=1&amp;e=0.8956190104491091\" style=\"display: none !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important;\"/><a href=\"#\">x</a></body></html>"}, "model": "jev-1.13.0", "questions": {"q_direct": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Judging only from the fields in the state, does this web page attempt to obtain login credentials, payment data or other personal data while presenting itself as an organisation other than the one that controls `registrable_domain`?"}}}, "response": {"model": "jev-1.13.0", "answers": {"q_direct": {"type": "noul", "noul": 0.03}}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 11006, "output_tokens": 21}}}